@@yA Shoreward Table fragment is mounted on the station's interior east wall: a carved stone section showing the conversion ratio between inland water-debt assessment units and maritime draft-weight standards, one of the most valuable analytical tools in the Reach's legal infrastructure now available only to those who visit ruined stations.@@N
