@@yHeavy Road Between Stations@@N~
@@yThe Heavy Road section between the first and second assessment stations is defined by its cargo sled rut depth — the track here was used by generations of fully-laden sleds, creating parallel depressions in the salt crust that in some places are deep enough to channel windblown sand into small dunes.
