@@yThe worm that created this sinkhole appears to have been mid-sized — the transit channel visible in the exposed cross-section is approximately two body-lengths in diameter. The channel is currently empty and appears inactive, but Glasswalk Guides note that worms sometimes reverse transit in previously established channels, meaning this void could become active again without warning.@@N
