@@bThe route's existence was apparently unknown to the Reach Wardens until a Cell operative left a route notation map in an abandoned station — the map showed the courier path in Eclipsed Tongues script, and though the script was not translatable, the path geometry itself was informative. The Wardens have since added this corridor to their patrol considerations, but their actual patrol coverage here remains sparse.
@@yThe route is still in use — Synod territorial markers in their characteristic small-scale notation appear at intervals along the path, more subtle here than in the Belt interior, designed to blend into the general terrain rather than serve as obvious waymarks. The Cell apparently understood that this route required concealment that the Belt's depth did not.@@N
