@@yThis appears to be a Reach Warden patrol observation post, the stone arrangements consistent with their documented surveillance technique for monitoring faction movement through contested transit corridors. The post's coverage of both the Guide's Song Marker junction and the Synod courier path suggests it was established specifically to monitor those two route systems simultaneously.@@N
