@@yA Warden sentry at the gatehouse checks visitors' purpose and affiliation before allowing passage — a conversational screening process rather than a search, since the Wardens rely on the Crossroads compound's general inaccessibility to filter out casual intruders. Anyone who has navigated the full district to reach this point has already demonstrated sufficient motivation to justify engagement rather than dismissal.@@N
