@@yThe passage surface shows the marks of multiple competing transit patterns — the regular worn path of Warden patrols, the heavier and more irregular disturbance of loaded Scavengers, and a third pattern of light foot traffic that leaves no marks beyond compressed surface that might be Synod Cells transiting the district's edges.@@N
