@@ySealed Route Fortification@@N~
@@yThe Sealed Route's fortification point is more substantial than any facility in the cairn district — a proper defensive structure with arrow loops, a gatehouse with portcullis mounting hardware, and flanking walls that would have made unauthorized transit very difficult.
