@@yThe portcullis is still in its raised position, the counterbalance mechanism frozen in place by decades of corrosion. A properly equipped maintenance crew could restore it to operational condition; the mechanism's fundamental engineering is still sound. The Wardens have not done so, which indicates they do not expect to have use for a functional portcullis in the near term.@@N
