@@yCell Operational Storage@@N~
@@yA dedicated storage area carved from the station's original secondary chamber holds the operational materials that the Cell maintains at this transit hub — courier supplies, message materials, route mapping slates for the Sealed Route corridor and tunnel system, and a locked chest whose weight suggests something substantially heavier than documents.
