@@yA courier debrief form for the most recent transit through this hub indicates that the Glasswind Belt tunnel and the Synod Whisper Cache above are actively in use, with courier transit frequency of approximately three times per tenday. The form uses the Cell's internal notation system, but the frequency indication is represented numerically and is unambiguous.@@N
