@@yRoute Terminus Ruin@@N~
@@yThe Sealed Route ends here — not gradually, not at a transition to another system, but simply: the path stops, the construction stops, and the terrain beyond is unmodified desert. The route was never completed as originally planned, or its completion was lost to the same Fracture Era events that ended its operation.
