@@yMarsh Clearing Rest Point@@N~
@@yA natural clearing in the saltmarsh vegetation provides a sheltered rest point — protected from the coastal wind by the surrounding plant mass, firm ground underfoot from an underlying rock shelf, and a view through gaps in the vegetation toward the sea that is blocked from the surrounding trail.
