@@yA water access regulation notice posted near the approach indicates that the Tidemouth Warden post controls well access during contested jurisdiction periods — the well is technically within the zone where both Reach Wardens and Harbor Wardens have claimed authority, and the current arrangement allows regulated access during posted hours.@@N
