@@yThe outer court shows the evidence of the assembly process — the space is sized for a cargo party of the typical scale (the foundation course dimensions imply an area large enough for approximately twenty people standing comfortably), and the assembly markers on the court floor indicate the formal positions required for the oath procedure.@@N
