@@bThe walls of the deep approach bear inscriptions that are neither Measure Script, maritime notation, nor the pre-Keeper proto-notation of the antechamber — a fourth notation system that no scholar has been able to identify, its symbols bearing an uncomfortable similarity to both human-designed notation and patterns that appear in certain natural formations.
