@@yThe wall inscription here is the most legible of the unidentified notation — a formal claim document written in the fourth script, asserting authority over this zone on behalf of an entity identified by a symbol that appears in no other known authority corpus. The claim appears to predate the Compact, the Keeper period, and possibly the current geological age of the Reach itself.@@N
