#31113
salt cricket swarm leader~
a salt cricket swarm leader~
A slightly denser concentration within the cricket swarm marks a larger, more aggressive cluster.
~
The swarm leader is not one creature but a denser knot of the salt crickets — faster, louder, and seemingly more coordinated than the rest. Travelers who have survived swarm encounters describe the leader cluster as the component that pressed the attack when the rest might have retreated, the part that kept the swarm coherent even as the outer edges scattered. It is the most urgent target for anyone trying to break a swarm attack quickly.
~
