corrupted warden toll-thief~
a corrupted warden toll-thief~
A warden whose patrol insignia has been defaced with crude overmarks blocks the path with calculating menace.
~
The corrupted toll-thief still wears the Reach Warden patrol gear — bronze helm, survey-mark belt, the leather folio of transit documents — but something in the posture and the eyes has shifted entirely away from any institutional mandate. The transit seal stamps carried are being used not to validate legitimate crossings but to extort payments from caravans that cannot afford to wait out a jurisdictional dispute at the edge of the desert. The Warden Commander at Measure's Rest has declared these individuals outside the patrol authority, but declarations from a distant fortress carry limited weight on the Flats.
~
