mineral crust elemental~
a mineral crust elemental~
A hulking form of salt-crystallized mineral rises from the flat surface, animated by some force bound into the Flats itself.
~
The mineral crust elemental is one of several such entities that the Mirror Flats generate — the salt and mineral concentration in the upper crust occasionally precipitates a crystalline structure so complex that some animating principle coheres within it. The result is not intelligent but is purposeful, moving through the Flats with the mindless hostility of a natural system defending its territory. Each limb is a column of compacted mineral crystal; each blow carries the force of several tons of concentrated matter.
~
