heavy road warden sentinel~
a heavy road warden sentinel~
A stocky warden sentinel stands at the assessment station with the immovable patience of someone paid by the day.
~
The Heavy Road assessment station is a key checkpoint on the southern Mirror Flats route, and the sentinel stationed here has clearly settled into the assignment as a near-permanent posting. Their gear shows long wear but excellent maintenance, and the transit ledger they consult shows entries going back months. They are more comfortable with caravans, more familiar with the merchants who make the Heavy Road run regularly, and consequently more nuanced in their judgments than the Gate sentinels at the Oasis.
~
