red sand outrider scout~
a red sand outrider scout~
A lean figure in a silk surcoat over travel leather surveys approaching caravans with predatory calculation.
~
The Red Sand outrider scout is the advance element of the Accounts' field operation — identifying distressed caravans, assessing cargo value, locating travelers who have taken on water-debt from other Accounts agents and are now overdue for payment. They maintain a pleasant, commercially professional exterior that takes real effort to see through, but the brass wax tablet they are annotating is not a travel journal. They are calculating interest schedules and identifying which members of which caravan have outstanding debt instruments.
~
