heavy road caravan guard~
a heavy road caravan guard~
A seasoned caravan guard rests one hand on their weapon and watches the surroundings with experienced vigilance.
~
The caravan guard's attention cycles through the full perimeter of the camp or route position in a pattern honed by many crossings — fauna approach vectors, rival faction positions, the glass-shimmer horizon that might be heat haze or might be an outrider scout signal. They are not affiliated with any of the Reach's factions, hired for the specific purpose of getting one caravan from one side to the other, and their neutrality in factional politics is absolute and commercially rational.
~
