salt slab golem~
a salt slab golem~
A towering construct of layered salt slabs moves with the slow, inexorable force of compacted mineral tons.
~
The salt slab golem predates the current Reach administrative history — it was created by one of the pre-Keeper survey operations to guard the assessment station that stood in this location, and it has continued guarding long after its creators, the station, and the authority they represented have all passed into history. Its awareness is limited to a simple threat detection protocol; it does not distinguish between authorized personnel and intruders, a fact that has caused repeated incidents in the Flats expeditionary history.
~
