glasswalk guide elder~
a glasswalk guide elder~
The guide elder reads the glass underfoot with the total confidence of someone for whom the Belt holds no surprises.
~
The elder is the senior Glasswalk lineage representative in this section of the Belt, combining navigational expertise with the accumulated social knowledge of many seasons spent between competing factions as a neutral party. They know the history of the Belt routes in the oral tradition's extensive form — the route songs that encode elevation change, glass type transitions, fauna territory boundaries, and seasonal hazard patterns in a mnemonic format that looks to outsiders like poetry but functions as a precision navigation system. The elder is also the faction contact for parties seeking guide services into the Belt's deeper sections.
~
