synod whisper courier~
a synod whisper courier~
A hooded figure moves through the glass terrain with the careful route-consciousness of someone avoiding the main paths deliberately.
~
The whisper courier carries the Eclipsed Tongues' liturgical wrapping cloths bundled around components that the Synod does not want assessed, inspected, or documented by any transit authority in the Reach. Their route takes specific advantage of the Glasswind Belt's disorienting terrain and the transit authorities' reluctance to follow unmarked paths — the same glass-reading skills that the Guides use for navigation have been adapted by the Synod for evasion. The courier's view of the Belt is religious as well as tactical: the fused glass is sacred evidence of the Ninth Meridian's purifying fire, and moving through it feels, to them, like moving through a sanctuary.
~
