synod ritual keeper~
a synod ritual keeper~
A robed figure traces glyphs in the glass surface with ritualistic focus, murmuring invocations in an archaic dialect.
~
The ritual keeper serves the Eclipsed Tongues' theological mandate as expressed in the Glasswind Belt — documenting the specific glass formations that the Synod believes correspond to the Ninth Meridian's active intervention, performing preservation rites over particularly sacred formations, and conducting the ceremonies that the cult maintains are required to keep the purifying fire properly commemorated. They are dangerous in combat because the same disciplined focus they apply to ritual work extends to the application of offensive spiritual techniques, and the Belt's environmental energy feeds the ritual forms they use.
~
