thermal fault elemental~
a thermal fault elemental~
A creature of heat and fractured earth rises from the thermal fault ridge, trailing smoke and fused glass shards.
~
The thermal fault elemental is a manifestation of the geologic forces that originally created the Glasswind Belt — the sustained heat that fused the surface and the mineral composition that made the Belt's distinctive glass rather than simple fused sand. It does not have purposes in any recognizable sense but processes anything in its vicinity as either geological material or an obstacle to geological process. The temperature differential that it carries is sufficient to fuse sand to glass on contact, and the projectile glass shards it generates are an incidental byproduct of the movement rather than a deliberate weapon.
~
