vitrified sand horror~
a vitrified sand horror~
A construct of glass-fused sand that should not be capable of movement is moving with terrible, purposeful speed.
~
The vitrified sand horror is a Synod creation — animated glass-sand aggregate given hostile mobile form through a ritual combining Eclipsed Tongues spiritual technique with the Belt's available thermal energy. It serves as a guardian construct in Synod-held sections of the Belt, difficult to damage because there is no single anatomical feature to target, capable of absorbing considerable damage before its structural coherence fails. The Synod considers its creation both practical security and theological statement: the purified matter of the Belt given active form.
~
