The molten glass sentinel is the most advanced and dangerous environmental entity in the Glasswind Belt proper — a formation where the subsurface thermal activity keeps a zone of glass perpetually at semi-liquid state, and within which something analogous to elemental consciousness has formed and hardened. Unlike the thermal fault elemental's geological process-mindlessness, the sentinel appears to make deliberate decisions about how it responds to intrusion, varying its approach, using the terrain, and specifically targeting the most dangerous element of an opposing group first. The area around it has the sweet-acid smell of glass at near-melting temperature.
~
