The post commander manages the Reach's most difficult jurisdictional position with practiced diplomatic precision.
~
The Tidemouth post commander is responsible for maintaining Reach Warden authority in the zone where it is most contested — directly adjacent to the Harbor Warden's claimed territory, at the precise boundary where both authorities have historical arguments for their jurisdiction and neither has the enforcement presence to make the claim definitive. The commander has developed a personal protocol for managing the competing demands of the inland authority they answer to and the maritime authority that controls their supply lines, and it has kept the post functioning through several escalations that should have triggered violent resolution.
~
