The conversion engine construct is a manifestation unique to the Shoreward Threshold — sections of the conversion mechanism that have become sufficiently animated by the accumulated weight of the legal and economic function they performed over decades of active operation that they now act independently. The mechanism was the physical expression of the Shoreward Tables' conversion formulas, and the animated portions still attempt to execute those functions on the physical matter they encounter, which in combat produces effects that are at once mechanical and jurisdictional. It is not alive in any biological sense but is not simply a construct in the traditional sense either.
~
