an undercroft watcher~
A revenant guard still walks the undercroft's passages, monitoring for the compliance violations that its eternal post was created to detect.
~
The undercroft watcher is among the oldest of the Threshold's undead — its uniform is of a design predating even the Shoreward Compact, suggesting it dates from the original assessment infrastructure that the Compact was built over and around. It maintains patrol routes through the undercroft's sealed passages, checking sealed chambers against a ledger that it consults from memory, and escalating to enforcement response when the sealed state of any chamber is compromised. It does not distinguish between the parties that sealed the chambers and those that have opened them; a broken seal is a compliance violation regardless of the authority of the party responsible.
~
