The Toll-Marshal of the Three Routes is the animated enforcement authority of the Shoreward Compact's three-route toll schedule — a construct created to embody the simultaneous jurisdiction of the Swift Line, the Heavy Road, and the Sealed Route at the point where all three converged on the Threshold. In the Compact's operational period, the Marshal was the final toll verification before the conversion process began; now it is the primary threat that any party attempting to reach the deeper Threshold chambers must overcome. Its three-route mandate means it applies the toll enforcement response of all three routes in parallel, producing an attack pattern of unusual complexity and force.
~
