The Shoreward Seal Guardian is the elite protection mechanism for the Compact's central Seal — the physical object and location that the entire Threshold administration was built to serve. It is not the most powerful entity in the Threshold, but it is the most specifically focused: its entire programming is the protection of one object in one location, and it executes that mandate with perfect efficiency. It does not wander, does not patrol, and does not respond to threats at range — it simply remains at the Seal and destroys anything that approaches without authorization. Authorization, in its operational context, requires the dual-notation seal of the Compact, which no one living holds.
